{
  "file" : "npc/quests/quests_izlude.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So are you heading to Alberta again? Let me give you the same discount and only charge 250 Zeny, just like the last time.",
      "translation" : "你又要去艾爾貝塔嗎？我還是給你和上次一樣的折扣，只收250 Zeny。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How's that sound?",
      "translation" : "怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 27,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alrighty~!",
      "translation" : "好啊~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 27,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why are you being so nice to me?!",
      "translation" : "你為什麼對我這麼好？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Um...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This isn't",
      "translation" : "錢"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "enough money.",
      "translation" : "不夠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you go",
      "translation" : "你為什麼不去"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "get some more cash?",
      "translation" : "再弄點現金呢？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's just the way I am. That, and your devilish smile reminds me of my beloved blond haired son who left home years ago to become a Sailor on his own ship. Bless his soul, wherever he is.",
      "translation" : "我就是這樣的人。再說，你那淘氣的笑容讓我想起我心愛的金髮兒子。他幾年前離家，駕駛自己的船出海當水手了。願他的靈魂安息，無論他身在何處。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My town, Izlude, is connected to Alberta by the harbor in the West. There is so much traffic between us, I almost become an Albertian.  Hehehe~",
      "translation" : "我的家鄉伊斯魯德通過西邊的港口與艾爾貝塔相連。兩地往來頻繁，我都快成艾爾貝塔人了。嘿嘿~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's this guy I know pretty well, Phelix, who lives in Alberta. That guy is really stingy... He charges for everything!",
      "translation" : "我認識一個住在艾爾貝塔的人，叫菲利克斯。那傢伙特別吝嗇...什麼都要收費！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But he's really a nice guy and likes helping other people. He has a good heart and will give you his support if you meet his price.",
      "translation" : "不過他人真的很好，也喜歡幫助別人。他心地善良，只要你付得起價錢，他就會支援你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Lately, people in Alberta say that he is really trying to help folks and that his demand for Jellopies is just a coverup.  Well, you should take a look at what he has to offer.",
      "translation" : "最近艾爾貝塔的人都說他很熱心助人，他收集果凍塊只是個幌子。你應該去看看他能提供什麼。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 57,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you tell me how to get to Alberta?",
      "translation" : "你能告訴我怎麼去艾爾貝塔嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 57,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Huh? Well, you can use your feet and just walk.  But if you have money, I'd like to suggest that you take a ship.",
      "translation" : "啊？你可以用腳走過去。不過如果你有錢，我建議你坐船。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Okay, gotcha.",
      "translation" : "好，知道了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But I'm sick of walking and I'm broke!",
      "translation" : "可是我走累了，而且身無分文！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alrighty, take care~",
      "translation" : "好吧，保重~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Okay...",
      "translation" : "好吧..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't want to walk AND you've got no cash, but you still want to go there? Oh geez...",
      "translation" : "你不想走路，又沒錢，卻還想去那裡？真是的..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Fine fine. Me, being the captain of a ship, can afford to bring you there at a lower price. How does 250 Zeny sound?",
      "translation" : "好吧好吧。我是船長，能以便宜些的價格送你過去。250 Zeny怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alrighty~!",
      "translation" : "好啊~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Bah, what a rip off!!",
      "translation" : "呸，太貴了！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Um...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This isn't",
      "translation" : "錢"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "enough money.",
      "translation" : "不夠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go and get",
      "translation" : "去弄"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "some more.",
      "translation" : "多一點吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Boy oh boy,",
      "translation" : "哎呀呀，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "if you think",
      "translation" : "如果你覺得"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "that's a rip off...",
      "translation" : "這都算敲詐的話..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yeah, alright.",
      "translation" : "好吧，行。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "See you later~",
      "translation" : "回頭見~"
    }
  ]
